"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years back to 1951, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids October to November came in under 90% of normal in 39 of them, more than any other pair. In 2025, April to May ran 197% of normal on the middle of the grids, and November to December ran just 25%. Every grid had its driest year in 1963, with grid 18759 at 52%.</p>"}
